h.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T10:46:41-07:00","id":1491784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1473176-exalted-forum-is-dead-again?p=1490882#post1490882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How can this forum be allowed to die?!</div> </div> </div> </div>This isn't something that can be fixed with a lot of grit and determination. Sometimes things break beyond repair.<br /> <br /> The forum software had some native flaws in it, the Exalted forum in particular probably strained itself too much with a massive amount of content*, and where once this kind of thing was probably offset by regular migration of the whole board... these forums just aren't nearly as active as they were nine years ago, by virtue of a combination of such discussion forums not really being in vogue anymore, a lot of the most regular posters having other things in their lives to move on to and, frankly, the fact that most White Wolf games don't have much in the way of a release schedule to keep a large range of lively conversation. <br /> <br /> * And perhaps some megathreads that were allowed to become way too long despite <i>somebody</i> trying to suggest that they should be regulated more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://